Z||000005||1FST2M6||02-07-2001||12:54 PM||||just like most parts aimed for the honda/acura market they are just smoke and mirrors. save your $ for a dual TB intake from chris west.. or a stock drop-in K&N... the only intake that makes HP that we'e dynoed on is an AEM. and they are tuned to the correct length and size for the right pulse and not to have resonance in the car... unfortunatly Advanced Engine Management doesn't make anything for our cars... the box can be purchased at Home Depot it's 3.5" outlet HVAC duct made with 18ga. aluminum.  a few have come through the shop...<P>sorry to rain on your parade...   <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BlackGTdyno.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BlackGTdyno.jpg</A> <BR>proof the K&N drop in helps... ||||reg||1
